{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/8e50eef9ffb674b0ff80858187a7cdd6.avif?t=1772569695\" width=1560 height=246 /></span><strong><br>Foster hand drawn cats</strong> in this cozy 2D cat simulation game with original lo-fi music.\u00a0 <br>  <br>Keep an eye on their <strong>hunger, happiness, cleanliness, and energy.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>mini-games to earn items and money</strong>\u00a0then spend your earnings in the <strong>shop</strong> to buy food, toys and more.<br>Send them on <strong>adventures</strong> to discover rare items, or let them out on adventures while you are not playing.\u00a0<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/dc7117579b9c5fe546e3b571874d93dd.avif?t=1772569695\" width=1560 height=246 /></span><br>Once the cat is ready they will go to their forever home - as you level up you will unlock new cats to foster, with new goals.\u00a0 <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4091580/extras/2e4dcb7df8e7a670a878a63cedb6e2d7.avif?t=1772569695\" width=1560 height=246 /></span><br><strong>Cozy &amp; Relaxing:</strong> A gentle 2D game designed for unwinding at your own pace.\u00a0 <br><strong>Wholesome Lo-Fi Vibes:</strong> No timers, no stress \u2014 just you, a cat and some goals to tick off when you are ready.   <br>OST by Jack the Robot </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Go Fishing","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091580/3a814c9e8847a566554a457a3b5fd5606222f468.jpg"},{"name":"Grab it","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4091580/d67dc5f2d49371ad3ebeb3afaecf55c59d76f3da.jpg"},{"name":"Snac